WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.647
Delivery day — the newest model, and a new Seoul branch.

00:00:05.647 --> 00:00:08.000
That string is the front line!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.013
The chip is in Seoul, the meter is at headquarters. Inference is easy.

00:00:14.753 --> 00:00:20.408
Welcome to full-scale production. The invoice swings with the building.

00:00:20.408 --> 00:00:23.018
So that is what a branch is.

00:00:23.018 --> 00:00:30.036
Model, data, meter — all moved to the building next door. That address is ours now.

00:00:30.036 --> 00:00:34.157
Now the meter runs on our pace.

00:00:34.157 --> 00:00:38.036
Oh dear, my pendulum is gone.

